{
  "source": "Prompts/document-trap-7.mp4",
  "duration": 198.7628125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.88,
      "text": "Your season-end basketball tournament starts next week, so you want to brush up on the rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.62,
      "end": 9.34,
      "text": "You upload your league's 200-page rulebook to quickly check a detail."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.02,
      "end": 12.92,
      "text": "You ask, how many fouls until I'm out of the game?"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.58,
      "end": 16.28,
      "text": "The AI answers, five fouls and you foul out."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.02,
      "end": 17.58,
      "text": "Wait a second."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.02,
      "end": 22.42,
      "text": "In last year's tournament, you remember a player picking up five fouls and staying in the game,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.84,
      "end": 24.56,
      "text": "so you dig through the rulebook yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.42,
      "end": 29.16,
      "text": "The regular season limit is five fouls, exactly what the AI said,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.16,
      "end": 32.04,
      "text": "but near the end, there's a special section for tournaments,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.74,
      "end": 34.32,
      "text": "and in those games, players get six."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.04,
      "end": 38.08,
      "text": "The AI pulled the standard limit while missing the tournament exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.86,
      "end": 40.52,
      "text": "This is an incomplete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.12,
      "end": 44.8,
      "text": "The document trap occurs when we assume uploaded means fully read."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.48,
      "end": 50.78,
      "text": "A retrieval machine selects a few pages from a long rulebook while leaving the six foul exception behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.52,
      "end": 54.2,
      "text": "Uploading a file doesn't mean the AI has read it all."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.66,
      "end": 58.6,
      "text": "AI can only answer from the document text that reaches its context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.6,
      "end": 61.24,
      "text": "A short file easily fits in full."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.74,
      "end": 65.44,
      "text": "With a long file, the system has to search for the parts that seem most relevant"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.44,
      "end": 68.04,
      "text": "and add those isolated passages instead."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.84,
      "end": 73.52,
      "text": "This chart shows the common three-step process the system uses when it confronts a long document."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.38,
      "end": 75.12,
      "text": "First is split."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.86,
      "end": 78.98,
      "text": "The system breaks the massive document down into much smaller pieces."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.94,
      "end": 80.64,
      "text": "Next is search."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.42,
      "end": 84.74,
      "text": "It looks for pieces that match your question based on keywords and meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.58,
      "end": 86.44,
      "text": "Finally, load."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.44,
      "end": 91.94,
      "text": "The system puts only those selected pieces into the context window for the AI to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.5,
      "end": 94.6,
      "text": "Search decides which parts reach the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.28,
      "end": 97.12,
      "text": "This is how the rulebook mistake happens."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.86,
      "end": 102.44,
      "text": "The search found the regular season foul limit, but it skipped the tournament exception entirely."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.28,
      "end": 106.2,
      "text": "That crucial passage never reached the AI's context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.94,
      "end": 108.36,
      "text": "There's a formal name for this process."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.08,
      "end": 111.48,
      "text": "Retrieval Augmented Generation, or RAG."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.94,
      "end": 115.72,
      "text": "The exact same mechanism pulls information from the web or a large database."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.72,
      "end": 121.38,
      "text": "When retrieval finds the right passages, the AI can answer a specific question in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.2,
      "end": 125.5,
      "text": "When retrieval misses something important, the AI misses it too."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.16,
      "end": 130.14,
      "text": "The answer can sound perfectly complete even when a vital passage was left out."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.88,
      "end": 135.64,
      "text": "This diagram outlines a four-step framework you can use to manually guide the search process."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.28,
      "end": 139.18,
      "text": "Start with name the section and ask one thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.76,
      "end": 143.44,
      "text": "For the rulebook, you apply this by asking, look in the tournament section."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.44,
      "end": 145.48,
      "text": "How many personal fouls are allowed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.2,
      "end": 147.66,
      "text": "Quote the rule and any exceptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.48,
      "end": 151.06,
      "text": "Naming the section gives the search a specific target."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.84,
      "end": 154.96,
      "text": "If the answer still misses the exception, use share what matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.64,
      "end": 159.88,
      "text": "You bypass the search by pasting the relevant tournament passage directly into the conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.86,
      "end": 161.74,
      "text": "Then ask for the quote."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.3,
      "end": 167.3,
      "text": "Instruct the AI to quote the rule so you can compare the text directly with the original uploaded document."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.02,
      "end": 171.82,
      "text": "A quotation is useful because you can check it, not because AI quoted it."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.82,
      "end": 174.9,
      "text": "This trap does not stare on the basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.52,
      "end": 180.94,
      "text": "Apartment leases, employment contracts, insurance policies, and financial aid letters"
    },
    {
      "start": 180.94,
      "end": 185.1,
      "text": "can all contain conditions or exceptions that alter the final answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.9,
      "end": 190.0,
      "text": "Uploading a document and asking AI for help is only a good starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.84,
      "end": 192.68,
      "text": "A missing passage can change the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.4,
      "end": 194.0,
      "text": "Ask for the passage."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.78,
      "end": 195.14,
      "text": "Then check it."
    }
  ],
